<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean Samsung Motors completes technical centre.</title>
<headline>S.Korean Samsung Motors completes technical centre.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Samsung Motors Inc, a unit of South Korea's Samsung Group, said on Wednesday it has completed construction of a technical centre in Kiheung, south of Seoul.</p>
<p>A statement said the company spent $169 million to build the facility. It plans to invest additional $393 million by 2005 to expand the centre.</p>
<p>The centre houses sections for engine testing, prototype production, research and development, safety testing and design.</p>
</text>
